---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
const lang = 'fr';
const t = (await import('../../translations/fr.json')).default;
---

<Layout lang={lang} title={t.nav.comparison} description={t.pages.comparison.metaDescription}>
  <h1>{t.nav.comparison}</h1>
  <p>Simpli vs Indonesian, English, Esperanto, Glosa, Globish.</p>

  <h2>Simple : « I see you »</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Langue</th><th>Phrase</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Simpli</td><td><em>mi sii yu</em></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Indonésien</td><td>Saya lihat kamu</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Anglais</td><td>I see you</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Espéranto</td><td>Mi vidas vin</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Glosa</td><td>Mi vide tu</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Globish</td><td>I see you</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Moyen : « Tomorrow, I will see you at my brother's house »</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Langue</th><th>Phrase</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Simpli</td><td><em>tumoro mi sii yu at haus broder mi</em></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Indonésien</td><td>Besok, saya akan bertemu Anda di rumah saudara laki-laki saya</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Anglais</td><td>Tomorrow, I will see you at my brother's house</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Espéranto</td><td>Morgaŭ, mi vidos vin ĉe la domo de mia frato</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Glosa</td><td>Crasti, mi vide tu a dom de mi fratri</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Globish</td><td>Tomorrow, I will see you at my brother's house</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Plus complexe : « Next week I will go to the market to buy food for my family »</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Langue</th><th>Phrase</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Simpli</td><td><em>nekst wik mi go to market to bai fuud for famli mi</em></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Indonésien</td><td>Minggu depan saya akan pergi ke pasar untuk membeli makanan untuk keluarga saya</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Anglais</td><td>Next week I will go to the market to buy food for my family</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Espéranto</td><td>Semajnon poste mi iros al la merkato por aĉeti manĝaĵon por mia familio</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Glosa</td><td>Proxi semani mi go a marketa e merka fag pro mi familia</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Globish</td><td>Next week I will go to the market to buy food for my family</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p><strong>Takeaway:</strong> Simpli is simpler than Esperanto, more regular than English, more intuitive than Glosa.</p>
</Layout>
